    "body": "https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/1431 \r\nGentoo cargo-ebuild , kida borkage ...  ne rate , cargo rpm/deb wala builds with rpmspecs etc.. \r\nebuild needs a tad more work ,  in gihub/gentoo/rust mirror, \r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\npi64 ~/starship # ls\r\nCODE_OF_CONDUCT.md  Cargo.lock  LICENSE    crowdin.yml  install  snapcraft.yaml  starship_module_config_derive  tests\r\nCONTRIBUTING.md     Cargo.toml  README.md  docs         media    src             target\r\npi64 ~/starship # cd /target\r\n-bash: cd: /target: No such file or directory\r\npi64 ~/starship # cd target\r\npi64 ~/starship/target # ls\r\ndebian  release\r\npi64 ~/starship/target # cd r*\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # ls\r\nbuild  deps  examples  incremental  libstarship.d  libstarship.rlib  rpmbuild  starship  starship.d\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # uname\r\nLinux\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # uname -a\r\nLinux pi64 5.4.45-v8-3b41649ff96d-p4-bis+ #2 SMP PREEMPT Tue Jun 16 14:11:43 GMT 2020 aarch64 GNU/Linux\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # ./starship\r\nstarship 0.43.0\r\nMatan Kushner <hello@matchai.me>\r\nThe cross-shell prompt for astronauts. ☄🌌️\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n    starship <SUBCOMMAND>\r\n\r\nFLAGS:\r\n    -h, --help       Prints help information\r\n    -V, --version    Prints version information\r\n\r\nSUBCOMMANDS:\r\n    bug-report     Create a pre-populated GitHub issue with information about your configuration\r\n    completions    Generate starship shell completions for your shell to stdout\r\n    config         Edit the starship configuration\r\n    explain        Explains the currently showing modules\r\n    help           Prints this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\r\n    init           Prints the shell function used to execute starship\r\n    module         Prints a specific prompt module\r\n    prompt         Prints the full starship prompt\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # ./starship prompt\r\n\r\nroot on pi64 in starship/target/release on  master [!?]\r\n❯ pi64 ~/starship/target/release # ./starship init\r\nerror: The following required arguments were not provided:\r\n    <SHELL>\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n    starship init [FLAGS] <SHELL>\r\n\r\nFor more information try --help\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release # ./starship config\r\npi64 ~/starship/target/release #\r\n\r\n```",
